    "detailed_description": "<h1>FOLLOW US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow us for the latest info:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twitter\uff1aVRS_VUP\u3001Neverland Entertainment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YouTube\uff1aNeverland_Entmt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord\uff1aNeverland_Entmt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/5b87bb41883e09afbc0e188fea16472e.avif?t=1737684254\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/b730caf42eb01c586b5bc1d5838b2e7a.avif?t=1737684254\" /></div><br><br>Called as Operators and fighting in a surreal, virtual world, Vtubers, just made a splendid debut of a magnificent performance\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/85fdecccd2498897472345ee7d35bc50.poster.avif?t=1737684254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/85fdecccd2498897472345ee7d35bc50.webm?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/85fdecccd2498897472345ee7d35bc50.mp4?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Virtua Unlimited Project is a 2D pixel-art style action game featuring VTuber characters. This is a world exclusively belonging to all sorts of Vtubers active in cyberspace. Playing as Aizawa Kana, a hot Vtuber, you will venture into this NEO Babylon world and fight with Vtubers capable of different superpowers. Will they appear as someone you are familiar with or challenge you with strange abilities? Don\u2019t let your guard down!<br><br>With core gameplay inspired by Rxxkman-Z series on GBA, this game combines many excellent features including adorable pixel visuals, classical platformer gameplay, retro combat designs, and many more exploration elements. Moreover, role-playing elements are emphasized enough for you to savor every moment of glitz and glamour of each Vtuber.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/0dd3fab2a4629736c83246123e160047.avif?t=1737684254\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/b1e2d7f51b2e1634d9f2010949643a0f.avif?t=1737684254\" /></div><br><br>In 2XXX, the world's largest quantum computer [Babylon] made a prediction.<br>Humanity will be extinguished within a century.<br><br>To save humanity, Dr. Hungerz Ridley proposed the#K{{ [New World Plan]}}.<br>According to it, all humans would hibernate in pods while nanobots work on the ecological restoration of Earth.<br>When awake, humans could start a new life in the reborn world.<br><br>The plan succeeded. Two new things emerged in the new world.<br>One is [Existence Support Point], or E.S.P in short.<br>The other is [Chaos Contamination Incident], also known as Chaos.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/e5e95031b5098328e84dac63bcb278f9.poster.avif?t=1737684254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/e5e95031b5098328e84dac63bcb278f9.webm?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Chaos incidents are unpredictable natural disasters.<br>In chaos, [Rioters] are continuously generated to <br>wreak havoc within a certain area with indiscriminate attacks.<br>The only way for humanity to tackle chaos is to keep destroying Rioters until the disasters completely disappear.<br><br>E.S.P is a new type of energy generated from the bonds between humans.<br>Humans can easily convert E.S.P into other types of energy through the current technologies.<br>Fortunately, E.S.P greatly helps humans tackle with chaos.<br><br>Some special humans can even harness E.S.P on their own.<br>With the supernatural power from E.S.P, they fight on the front line against chaos.<br>At the forefront of every industry, they play an active role in boosting global development through E.S.P.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/f4317ea363466509814a64fb3ba8ed76.poster.avif?t=1737684254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/f4317ea363466509814a64fb3ba8ed76.webm?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>They are called as \u2014 &quot;Operator&quot;.<br><br>Based on E.S.P, [NEO Babylon Government] built a new currency system.<br>As the NEO Babylon Government's 50th anniversary ceremony draws on.<br>some unpredictable undercurrents seem to be rising in this peaceful world\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/def05cbdd628d03f713625e299983147.avif?t=1737684254\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/c5cb971eeff211b086623bc7b45f9a1d.poster.avif?t=1737684254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/c5cb971eeff211b086623bc7b45f9a1d.webm?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/c5cb971eeff211b086623bc7b45f9a1d.mp4?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>By defeating &quot;Operator&quot; Bosses, players can acquire some parts of Bosses\u2019 powers and attributes. The attribute growth can also enhance players\u2019 support skills and activate EX Skill.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/de345f760439f9409bd10a5d3162e4b3.avif?t=1737684254\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/e0be437bdccc68aded0a8adda351199b.poster.avif?t=1737684254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/e0be437bdccc68aded0a8adda351199b.webm?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/e0be437bdccc68aded0a8adda351199b.mp4?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>There are element counter rules among Bosses, and knowing how to exploit this is key to victory.<br>After some &quot;friendly communications&quot;, the Boss will join your side. They can be summoned and aid you in combats with &quot;Support Skills&quot;.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/a4b2601e76a121b42951b88b88715eb0.poster.avif?t=1737684254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/a4b2601e76a121b42951b88b88715eb0.webm?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/a4b2601e76a121b42951b88b88715eb0.mp4?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/488adca598730e2bb661d909ddcd9fca.avif?t=1737684254\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/4cae4df52b54648ef8bca46fd09fadcd.poster.avif?t=1737684254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/4cae4df52b54648ef8bca46fd09fadcd.webm?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/4cae4df52b54648ef8bca46fd09fadcd.mp4?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game introduces action system highlighted by the &quot;Extreme Flying Kick.&quot; It can be used to interact with environments and enemies, and grants the character a brief period of invincibility after kicking the target. It can be canceled out by other special moves, providing a combination of different tricks to be explored!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/48712230a90081d8579d006dbf4c0ca0.avif?t=1737684254\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/63cf5b30d1d74306d25170c90a31c394.poster.avif?t=1737684254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/63cf5b30d1d74306d25170c90a31c394.webm?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/63cf5b30d1d74306d25170c90a31c394.mp4?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Hidden in the game levels are various &quot;Extensions&quot; such as &quot;Ice Surface Anti-Slip,&quot; &quot;Quick Charge,&quot; &quot;Auto Charge,&quot; &quot;Auto Recovery,&quot; a range of special abilities for the character. <br>Please actively explore every nook and cranny of the levels. Plan and increase the slots of Extension that can be installed, and over-install is allowed but with penalties.",
