hrough E.S.P.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/f4317ea363466509814a64fb3ba8ed76.poster.avif?t=1737684254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/f4317ea363466509814a64fb3ba8ed76.webm?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>They are called as \u2014 &quot;Operator&quot;.<br><br>Based on E.S.P, [NEO Babylon Government] built a new currency system.<br>As the NEO Babylon Government's 50th anniversary ceremony draws on.<br>some unpredictable undercurrents seem to be rising in this peaceful world\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/def05cbdd628d03f713625e299983147.avif?t=1737684254\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/c5cb971eeff211b086623bc7b45f9a1d.poster.avif?t=1737684254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/c5cb971eeff211b086623bc7b45f9a1d.webm?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/c5cb971eeff211b086623bc7b45f9a1d.mp4?t=1737684254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>By defeating &quot;Operator&quot; Bosses, players can acquire some parts of Bosses\u2019 powers and attributes. The attribute growth can also enhance players\u2019 support skills and activate EX Skill.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934030/extras/de345f760439f9409bd10a5d3162e4b3.avif?t=1737684254\" /></div><br><br><div cl